  "items": [
    {
      "id": "69b6c8bfdd1a4c9c86f0d02a",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324",
      "bookIndex": 32,
      "hadithIndex": 3650,
      "bookHadithIndex": 101,
      "text": "It was narrated from ‘Ali bin Abu Talib that the Prophet (ﷺ) said:“The angels do not enter a house in which there is a dog or an image.”",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-32-3650-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-32-3650-muhammadfouadabdalbaqi",
          "name": "Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi",
          "grade": "Sahih Lighairihi"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-32-3650-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-32-3650-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c8bfdd1a4c9c86f0d02b",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324",
      "bookIndex": 32,
      "hadithIndex": 3651,
      "bookHadithIndex": 102,
      "text": "It was narrated that ‘Aishah said:“Jibril (as) promised the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) that he would come to him at a certain hour, but he was late. The Prophet (ﷺ) went out and there was Jibril standing at the door. He said: ‘What kept you from entering?’ He said: ‘There is a dog in the house, and we do not enter a house in which there is a dog or an image.’”",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-32-3651-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-32-3651-muhammadfouadabdalbaqi",
          "name": "Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-32-3651-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-32-3651-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c8bfdd1a4c9c86f0d02c",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324",
      "bookIndex": 32,
      "hadithIndex": 3652,
      "bookHadithIndex": 103,
      "text": "It was narrated from Abu Umamah that a woman came to the Prophet (ﷺ) and told him that her husband was away on some military campaign. She asked him for permission to make an image of a palm tree in her house, and he did not let her, or he forbade her",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-32-3652-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-32-3652-muhammadfouadabdalbaqi",
          "name": "Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-32-3652-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-32-3652-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c8bfdd1a4c9c86f0d02d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324",
      "bookIndex": 32,
      "hadithIndex": 3653,
      "bookHadithIndex": 104,
      "text": "It was narrated that ‘Aishah said:“I covered a small room closet of mine, meaning, from the inside, with a curtain on which there were images. When the Prophet (ﷺ) came, he tore it down, so I made two pillows from it, and I saw the Prophet (ﷺ) reclining on one of them.”",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-32-3653-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-32-3653-muhammadfouadabdalbaqi",
          "name": "Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-32-3653-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-32-3653-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Isnaad Hasan Bukhari And Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c8bfdd1a4c9c86f0d02e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324",
      "bookIndex": 32,
      "hadithIndex": 3654,
      "bookHadithIndex": 105,
      "text": "It was narrated that ‘Ali said:“The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) forbade rings of gold and Al-Mitharah,”* meaning the red ones",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-32-3654-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-32-3654-muhammadfouadabdalbaqi",
          "name": "Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-32-3654-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-32-3654-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c8bfdd1a4c9c86f0d02f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324",
      "bookIndex": 32,
      "hadithIndex": 3655,
      "bookHadithIndex": 106,
      "text": "It was narrated that ‘Amir Al-Hajri said:“I heard Abu Raihanah, the Companion of the Prophet (ﷺ) say: ‘The Prophet (ﷺ) used to forbid riding on leopard skins.’”",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-32-3655-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-32-3655-muhammadfouadabdalbaqi",
          "name": "Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-32-3655-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih Lighairihi"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324-32-3655-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c8bfdd1a4c9c86f0d030",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1324",
      "bookIndex": 32,
      "hadithIndex": 3656,
      "bookHadithIndex": 107,
      "text": "It was narrated that Mu’awiyah said:“The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) used to forbid riding on leopard skins.”",
      "grades": [
